{"dpi": 300, "w": 2480, "h": 3507, "rows": [{"h": 56.07121942252662, "t": "(2)", "x": 1064.3121171633597, "y": 208.99273275128033, "c": 1, "w": 76.38603210449219}, {"t": "JYK", "x": 1043.9425072720958, "c": 1, "y": 305.84302429355904, "w": 112.03285217285156, "h": 40.77906728416085}, {"c": 1, "y": 396.61949680988226, "w": 270.2975463867188, "t": "PART-1", "x": 967.3563628698714, "h": 58.024088934590736}, {"y": 401.45369387267607, "h": 53.453077115110034, "t": "30 Marks", "c": 1, "w": 265.27246093750006, "x": 1797.3843053048965}, {"h": 66.44616786756698, "y": 524.8503425431551, "w": 427.7618103027344, "x": 891.1704338285094, "c": 1, "t": "(MCQ Portion)"}, {"c": 1, "x": 112.03283392106528, "t": "\u2022 Answers to MCQs are to be marked on the OMR answer sheet as given on the cover", "y": 794.7733753423018, "w": 1838.3572998046873, "h": 61.98232611174447}, {"t": "page of the descriptive answer book only. Answer to MCQs, if written inside the", "w": 1777.2484130859375, "c": 1, "x": 173.14172498721587, "y": 901.7428728291609, "h": 61.98232611174486}, {"t": "descriptive answer book shall not be evaluated.", "w": 972.6488647460935, "x": 178.23408362832208, "y": 1003.7137964826892, "h": 56.983751425313265, "c": 1}, {"y": 1136.6758836148583, "h": 61.20929023640449, "w": 1843.4497070312498, "x": 106.94042609669553, "c": 1, "t": "\u2022 Please write and darken correct MCQ booklet number in the OMR answer sheet. The"}, {"x": 178.23415197501402, "c": 1, "y": 1248.6439572663166, "w": 1599.0142822265625, "h": 56.28627460168732, "t": "correct MCQ booklet number must also be written in the attendance register."}, {"w": 437.9465942382812, "h": 51.22957859452537, "y": 1508.5698406197494, "t": "Case Scenario -I :", "c": 1, "x": 112.03285939557543}, {"x": 112.03286205179438, "t": "Graphite Core Industries established in 1995 is globally recognized for", "c": 1, "y": 1671.5233749264082, "w": 1843.4497070312498, "h": 66.98090079817568}, {"c": 1, "h": 66.26598624356645, "x": 106.9404288635676, "y": 1804.4738385709131, "t": "producing reliable, high quality wooden pencils. It begins its production process by", "w": 1843.4497070312498}, {"x": 106.66947598926618, "c": 1, "y": 1931.036279980648, "w": 1854.21630859375, "h": 76.78676712879972, "t": "sourcing raw graphite, clay, and cedar wood slats, holding them as raw materials."}, {"w": 1701.4332275390625, "t": "The following are details about the manufacturing processes of the company :", "c": 1, "x": 111.72539606919895, "y": 2063.7609318921614, "h": 70.48489128034473}, {"y": 2232.3634548851774, "t": "Core Manufacturing Process - In this process, the graphite and clay are mixed,", "h": 66.98090079817568, "w": 1863.8192138671875, "c": 1, "x": 91.663265045873}, {"c": 1, "t": "extruded into rods and fired to create hardened pencil cores known as lead.", "h": 61.168604739851396, "x": 224.06570901875307, "y": 2365.186046382327, "w": 1726.324462890625}, {"t": "Simultaneously, the cedar wood is cut into grooved slats. The output of this", "c": 1, "y": 2492.2893368350983, "h": 66.98090079817568, "w": 1726.324462890625, "x": 224.0657054222438}, {"x": 218.97333350839017, "t": "process ie. lead and grooved slat is transferred to the Casing & Shaping", "c": 1, "w": 1731.416748046875, "y": 2614.957851626333, "h": 81.55813456832209}, {"y": 2752.2152222291434, "x": 218.9733302781642, "w": 947.1868286132812, "h": 61.98232611174447, "c": 1, "t": "Process at 30% profit on the transfer price."}, {"h": 45.876452601486015, "t": "D", "x": 106.94045151425892, "w": 40.73921966552736, "c": 1, "y": 2951.385174479744}, {"t": "JYK", "x": 1028.6652998798986, "c": 1, "y": 2956.4825583281086, "w": 112.03285217285156, "h": 45.876452601486015}]}